						{
							"answer": "\\{ {{eval:-h-m}} ; {{eval:-h+m}} \\}",
							"message": "$x{{eval:-h;+}}=\\pm{{m}}$ donne $x={{h}}\\pm{{m}}$ : attention au signe.",
							"label": "Signe de α"
						}
					]
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On complète le carré : $x^2{{eval:b;+}}x=(x{{eval:-h;+}})^2-{{eval:h^2}}$, donc ${{eval:x^2+bx+c}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{(x{{eval:-h;+}})^2-{{eval:m^2}}}$.",
					"$(x{{eval:-h;+}})^2={{eval:m^2}} \\iff x{{eval:-h;+}}={{m}}$ ou $x{{eval:-h;+}}=-{{m}}$.",
					"Donc $S=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\{ {{eval:h-m}} ; {{eval:h+m}} \\}}$."
				]
			},
			"hint": "Complète le carré : $x^2+bx=\\left(x+\\dfrac{b}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(\\dfrac{b}{2}\\right)^2$."
